itsuki. Their relationship is complicated, however, because unbeknownst to them both, Yuka is a Shokujinki and Toshihiko is sworn to kill her. Meanwhile, the Kifuuken is having a crisis of confidence as Toshihiko's brother Kazuma pushes against tradition and tries to modernize the Kifuuken. As emotions are strained and the secrets of both the past and present are revealed, who will live, and who will be eaten?\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fugitive","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Psychosexual","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Monster Girl","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Samurai","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Surreal Comedy","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Denpa","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mixed Media","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Kemonozume","english":null,"native":"ケモノヅメ","romaji":"Kemonozume","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"兽爪"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}